    "name": "Enforcers Revolt",
    "steam_appid": 2889940,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enforcers Revolt is an exhilarating Player Vs Player online game, pitting teams of 10 against each other in intense battles, players are immersed in thrilling and strategic combat scenarios. For those looking to hone their skills or explore the game's intricacies, single-player modes against bots offer an opportunity to master maps and game mechanics. Join the rebellion and engage in epic clashes where teamwork, strategy, and skill determine the victors in this classic Arcade game Enforcers Revolt. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889940/extras/e3ecd890dc8a0f85e854ed351ab989ec.avif?t=1741678399\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enforcers Revolt is an action-packed third-person shooter, delivering intense multiplayer battles across 12 diverse maps. Whether you're strategizing with friends or going solo, the game offers a thrilling experience with its 8 distinct game modes, including:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquest</strong> \u2013 Capture and hold key points on the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rush</strong> \u2013 Attack or defend objectives in a fast-paced battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kill Confirmed</strong> \u2013 Eliminate enemies and collect their Dogtags.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team Deathmatch</strong> \u2013 Classic team-based combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture the Flag</strong> \u2013 Steal the enemy\u2019s flag and return it safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free for All</strong> \u2013 No teams, just chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search and Destroy</strong> \u2013 Tactical bomb-planting missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elimination</strong> \u2013 One life per round last team standing wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 24 unique characters to choose from, each offering their own unique voices and styles, you can tailor your experience to fit your combat preferences. Squad up with up to 5 players in the party system, dominate the battlefield, and climb the leaderboards as you track your individual stats and achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to test your skills, outgun your opponents, and become a legend in Enforcers Revolt!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mature Content Description:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages including strong language, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: General Mature Content</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enforcers Revolt is an exhilarating Player Vs Player online game, pitting teams of 10 against each other in intense battles, players are immersed in thrilling and strategic combat scenarios. For those looking to hone their skills or explore the game's intricacies, single-player modes against bots offer an opportunity to master maps and game mechanics. Join the rebellion and engage in epic clashes where teamwork, strategy, and skill determine the victors in this classic Arcade game Enforcers Revolt. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889940/extras/e3ecd890dc8a0f85e854ed351ab989ec.avif?t=1741678399\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enforcers Revolt is an action-packed third-person shooter, delivering intense multiplayer battles across 12 diverse maps. Whether you're strategizing with friends or going solo, the game offers a thrilling experience with its 8 distinct game modes, including:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquest</strong> \u2013 Capture and hold key points on the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rush</strong> \u2013 Attack or defend objectives in a fast-paced battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kill Confirmed</strong> \u2013 Eliminate enemies and collect their Dogtags.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team Deathmatch</strong> \u2013 Classic team-based combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture the Flag</strong> \u2013 Steal the enemy\u2019s flag and return it safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free for All</strong> \u2013 No teams, just chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search and Destroy</strong> \u2013 Tactical bomb-planting missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elimination</strong> \u2013 One life per round last team standing wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 24 unique characters to choose from, each offering their own unique voices and styles, you can tailor your experience to fit your combat preferences. Squad up with up to 5 players in the party system, dominate the battlefield, and climb the leaderboards as you track your individual stats and achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to test your skills, outgun your opponents, and become a legend in Enforcers Revolt!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mature Content Description:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages including strong language, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: General Mature Content</p>",
